      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>resilience? i dont feel resilient. i just feel heavy. like there's zero point in fighting to stay in a world that's already decided i don't belong here. it's like everyone's already moved on to the next thing they can hate, and i'm just stuck in this wreckage. it would be so much easier if i could just... stop being a burden to everyone who has to look at me. to just stop the noise.",
