    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"you do not belong there.\" that's exactly it. it's such a strange thing to hear, but it's the only thing that feels true anymore. everyone else is living in a world that i'm not a part of. i feel like a glitch in the system. sometimes i think if i just... went away, if i actually finalized the disappearance everyone expects from me, maybe the world would just feel whole again. like it could finally close the loop on this whole mess.",
